      "notes": "Pending owner review; not an approval. Owner Q55: the round bale's sector seams, on the upright variant. Same fix as hay_bale_round (periodic straw and relief, 11 net lines per sector, receiver keeps LOD0's edge normals; the straw reads the lathe frame before the slump so the lean keeps it periodic). Same mesh, tris and UVs; new albedo, normal and ORM. Measured: sector seam albedo step 14.4 -> 5.6 (interior 8.5), normal step 10.1 -> 2.0 deg at LOD0, 14.5 -> 4.2 and 10.4 -> 2.3 deg at LOD1. Review docs/checkpoints/hay-bale-seams/sheet.jpg."
